》（MATH20003） → 《机器学习》（ICE50015）。向量、矩阵及线性映射为理解学习模型提供数学准备。方案分别列在第1、5学期。","可以对照着读　《原子核物理》（PHYS30005）与《AI与理论核物理》（PHYS30023）。两门课的题名都涉及核物理。围绕一个核结构或辐射现象，区分模型描述的量与可供比较的观测证据。","查模块选课　《原子物理学》（PHYS20017）、《粒子物理学》（PHYS40023）列在“专业核心教育课程”中。模块说明写明“要求修读44学分（部分课程学分可用荣誉课程学分替换）”。原表见 /courseModules/6。"],"sourceUrl":"https://fdjwgl.fudan.edu.cn/manager/bizType/2/major-program-search/info/97128?skipAuth=1","wordUrl":"https://github.com/pythonbug225/fudan-course-atlas/blob/research/schoolwide-cohorts-2023-2025/research/contributions/%E6%A0%B8%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E7%B3%BB/cohorts-2023-2025/2025/originals/plan-97128.docx","originalUrl":"https://github.com/pythonbug225/fudan-course-atlas/blob/research/schoolwide-cohorts-2023-2025/research/contributions/%E6%A0%B8%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E7%B3%BB/cohorts-2023-2025/2025/originals/plan-97128.docx","graphUrl":"https://github.com/pythonbug225/fudan-course-atlas/blob/research/schoolwide-cohorts-2023-2025/research/contributions/%E6%A0%B8%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E7%B3%BB/cohorts-2023-2025/2025/plans/97128.md","syllabusReferences":[]}